{"description":"Very large family house in a quiet green setting. Very close to Paris. Built in the 1900s, this manor house in Meulière stone offers you the countryside at the gates of Paris and in close proximity to many Olympic sites.Located in a quiet and commercial area, nestled in a green setting, it will be a peaceful haven for your stay in the capital.Very large shaded garden (1000 m2) and sunny terrace - South facing.The spaceOn the ground floor of the house, huge living/dining room of 80 m2 and very large family kitchen of 23 m2. Toilets.On the 1st floor, 2 large bedrooms with double bed, each with private bathroom. Separate toilet.On the 2nd floor, one bedroom with double bed and one bedroom with double bed + sofa bed that can accommodate 4 people in total. Each of the bedrooms has its own private bathroom. Separate toilet.At the front of the house, a paved courtyard allows you to park up to 4 cars.Land fully fenced and protected by an electric gate.Guest accessAccess to the entire house and garden. This is our main residence. We leave our personal belongings there. But we make room in the bedroom cupboards for your own belongings.","amenities":[{"title":"Bath","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hairdryer","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Cleaning products","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Shampoo","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Body soap","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Shower gel","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Washing machine","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Free dryer – In unit","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Essentials","available":true,"subtitle":"Towels, bed sheets, soap and toilet paper"},{"title":"Hangers","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Bed linen","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Extra pillows and blankets","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Iron","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Clo